WEBVTT

00:02.640 --> 00:06.210
<i>This is the third time 
your son's hurt somebody.</i>

00:06.210 --> 00:09.140
<i>As his father, how will 
you take responsibility?</i>

00:09.140 --> 00:10.750
<i>Please forgive me.</i>

00:11.120 --> 00:14.090
<i>It's a definite case of 
parental inattention.</i>

00:12.740 --> 00:18.490
<b>BREAKING</b>

00:12.740 --> 00:18.490
<b>ACTOR'S ELDEST ARRESTED FOR ASSAULT!</b>

00:14.090 --> 00:18.500
<i>Parents these days are too lenient with 
their children when they're young!</i>

00:18.500 --> 00:21.250
<i>They need to be firm when teaching
them about right and wrong!</i>

00:21.250 --> 00:23.960
Is that what parenting's about?

00:24.440 --> 00:27.490
I wonder if we're too lenient, too.

00:29.020 --> 00:31.490
You think she might end up the same way?

00:36.050 --> 00:38.990
Shoplifting, Miri? Why?!

00:36.050 --> 00:42.430
<b>Don't Do It!!</b>

00:36.050 --> 00:42.430
<b>Watch Out for Phone Scams!!</b>

00:36.050 --> 00:42.430
<b>Keep Calm!
Talk to Someone!</b>

00:36.050 --> 00:42.430
<b>The Phone Scam Prevention Society</b>

00:38.990 --> 00:42.440
'Cause I was raised by 
scum like you, old fart!

00:42.440 --> 00:44.340
I'm not old!

00:44.850 --> 00:47.290
But our Miri would never. Right?

00:47.710 --> 00:52.440
Of course, the other mothers all 
say the same about their kids.

00:52.440 --> 00:53.940
"Other mothers"?

00:53.940 --> 00:57.310
Hey. What'll we do if Miri breaks bad?

00:57.310 --> 00:58.580
You're one to talk.

00:58.800 --> 01:01.180
I'm <i>exactly</i> the one to talk!

01:01.180 --> 01:01.990
Look at me!

01:01.990 --> 01:04.970
Parental abandonment is the 
reason I turned out this way!

01:06.200 --> 01:09.640
Parental influence is so crucial, isn't it?

01:09.640 --> 01:10.550
Right!

01:10.550 --> 01:13.970
As Miri's parental figure,
 I gotta be attentive!

01:13.960 --> 01:21.970
<b>SUSPECT IN CONVENIENCE STORE THEFTS</b>

01:14.200 --> 01:16.070
<i>Now, our next story.</i>

01:14.240 --> 01:15.440
What are you gonna do?

01:15.440 --> 01:17.060
All of it! Absolutely all of it!

01:16.070 --> 01:19.830
<i>Last night, a local convenience 
store was robbed.</i>

01:17.060 --> 01:17.940
Do your best.

01:17.940 --> 01:19.140
Aw, thanks...

01:19.140 --> 01:20.720
Wait, you gotta do it, too!

01:19.830 --> 01:21.980
<i>The culprit was armed with 
something like a gun...</i>

01:22.350 --> 01:25.890
<i>Hey, I want to love, is this true love?</i>

01:25.890 --> 01:29.520
<i>Is just wanting to be loved insincere?</i>

01:29.520 --> 01:31.770
<i>What should I do?</i>

01:31.770 --> 01:34.150
<i>Oh, what should I do?</i>

01:37.450 --> 01:40.450
<i>As usual, the whole city</i>

01:40.450 --> 01:44.120
<i>Is madly in love and excited</i>

01:44.120 --> 01:47.670
<i>Extras like me just go home</i>

01:47.670 --> 01:50.960
<i>But I'm not sulking at all</i>

01:50.960 --> 01:54.800
<i>"And then you appeared suddenly</i>

01:54.800 --> 01:58.340
<i>As though you were ripping 
through those days</i>

01:58.340 --> 02:01.930
<i>With your smile that leaves me numb</i>

02:01.930 --> 02:06.270
<i>You shattered my heart</i>

02:07.430 --> 02:11.020
<i>Hey, I want to love, is this true love?</i>

02:11.020 --> 02:14.650
<i>Is just wanting to be loved insincere?</i>

02:14.650 --> 02:16.820
<i>What should I do?</i>

02:16.820 --> 02:19.150
<i>Oh, what should I do?</i>

02:19.450 --> 02:21.530
<i>How the heck should I know?</i>

02:21.530 --> 02:25.370
<i>I don't know what's going on in your head</i>

02:25.370 --> 02:29.040
<i>But it's not fair that you're so friendly</i>

02:29.040 --> 02:33.750
<i>Once again, I'm being 
swallowed up by your rhythm</i>

02:35.920 --> 02:40.590
<i>There you go, you've got me 
wrapped around your finger again</i>

02:46.890 --> 02:51.770
<i>There you go, you've got me 
wrapped around your finger again</i>

02:52.470 --> 02:55.780
Miri-chan! Your papa's here for you!

02:55.780 --> 02:59.030
Papa Kazuki! Just a minute!

02:59.030 --> 03:00.020
Sure.

03:01.120 --> 03:02.950
Tomorrow's the field trip, huh?

03:02.950 --> 03:07.950
<b>Field Trip Information

May brings lots of warm days, and the flowers
 in our flower bed are blooming beautifully. 
We'll be taking an excursion to the Municipal Zoo 
to broaden the our experiences outside of daycare.

Day: May 27th (Saturday)
Location: Municipal Zoo
Time: 9:30-14:30 (Expected)
\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h(We'll arrive at daycare, then take a bus to the destination)
Clothing: Anything + Active shoes (Broken in, please)
Bring With You: Packed lunch, water bottle (filled with tea or water), 
\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hsnack, handkerchief, tissues, plastic bag, anything else needed
*Please: Get to bed early the night before, and get enough sleep. 
If you're not feeling well the morning of, it's okay to stay home. 
If you're going to be absent, please call your class teacher by 9 AM. 
Outside school hours, call the director's cell phone.

And we kindly ask that parents STAY HOME!

Aozora Daycare</b>

03:03.220 --> 03:06.020
I'm gonna pack one heck of a lunch for her!

03:06.020 --> 03:07.950
Can I talk to you?

03:08.170 --> 03:09.520
Miss Anna?

03:09.520 --> 03:11.710
Well... Today, Miri-chan...

03:12.220 --> 03:15.710
I'm told she got in a fight with a friend.

03:15.710 --> 03:16.830
A fight?

03:16.830 --> 03:19.580
I wasn't there to see it,

03:19.580 --> 03:23.340
but one of the children said it 
was Miri-chan who hit first.

03:23.340 --> 03:24.710
Miri did?!

03:25.050 --> 03:28.240
I've tried asking them, but you 
know how it is with young kids...

03:28.240 --> 03:30.420
It's so hard to get a straight 
answer out of them.

03:30.420 --> 03:34.740
I was hoping you might help 
us get to the bottom of it.

03:36.040 --> 03:38.990
It's already go time, is it?

03:39.350 --> 03:40.830
You got it!

03:40.830 --> 03:43.990
Leave this to Papa Kazuki!

03:43.990 --> 03:46.750
Oh, how gallant!

03:46.750 --> 03:49.400
That would be such a big help!

03:59.010 --> 04:01.400
Papa Rei's so good!

04:03.660 --> 04:07.440
Papa Rei's the <i>Morio Kart</i> master!

04:11.080 --> 04:12.140
Hey, Miri.

04:12.420 --> 04:14.100
Yeah? What?

04:14.100 --> 04:16.540
Anna-chan told me a little story.

04:16.540 --> 04:18.960
Did you get in a fight today?

04:18.960 --> 04:20.280
Nope.

04:21.190 --> 04:24.290
Right, but didn't you have a little 
argument with a kid in your class—

04:24.290 --> 04:26.310
Yeah, he caught up!

04:26.560 --> 04:29.160
Miri, this is very important.

04:29.160 --> 04:31.390
Look at me!

04:31.830 --> 04:34.050
You got into a fight, didn't you?

04:34.050 --> 04:35.100
What?

04:35.100 --> 04:39.210
I mean, did you hit one of 
your friends or something?

04:39.210 --> 04:40.830
Fight? Did you win?

04:40.830 --> 04:42.540
You're not helping!

04:43.070 --> 04:44.710
Well, Miri?

04:45.810 --> 04:48.170
Is it true that you hit someone?

04:48.170 --> 04:49.470
I didn't hit him!

04:49.760 --> 04:53.970
Then why don't you tell 
me <i>exactly</i> what happened?

04:53.970 --> 04:56.360
I'll give you full benefit of the doubt!

04:56.360 --> 04:57.980
What are you so worked up about?

04:57.980 --> 04:59.560
Well, like...

04:59.560 --> 05:03.240
Taiga-kun was being bad.

05:03.240 --> 05:05.680
Um... what do you mean by that?

05:05.680 --> 05:07.020
He was mean.

05:07.020 --> 05:09.480
That's not helping, Miri.

05:09.760 --> 05:13.850
You need to tell me who was at fault, 
and how it escalated to a fight!

05:13.850 --> 05:17.920
These are the times when parent-child 
communication is crucial!

05:17.920 --> 05:20.630
Um... I dunno.

05:20.630 --> 05:21.880
Yeah, that wasn't very clear.

05:21.880 --> 05:23.250
I said stay out of it!

05:23.250 --> 05:25.020
Papa's mad.

05:25.020 --> 05:26.690
No, I'm not mad!

05:26.690 --> 05:29.140
I just want to talk to you!

05:29.650 --> 05:33.490
If you've done something wrong, 
I have to set you straight.

05:33.490 --> 05:35.350
That's my job as your papa.

05:36.190 --> 05:38.350
But I didn't do anything wrong.

05:38.640 --> 05:41.040
That's up to me to decide.

05:41.040 --> 05:44.470
You don't really know 
right from wrong, do you?

05:44.470 --> 05:45.370
I do so!

05:45.370 --> 05:47.390
No, you don't.

05:47.390 --> 05:48.250
You're still a kid!

05:48.250 --> 05:49.490
I do so!

05:51.110 --> 05:52.490
Listen, Miri.

05:52.490 --> 05:55.610
I'm doing this because I care about you.

05:55.610 --> 05:57.820
At times like these, Papa Kazuki—

05:57.020 --> 05:59.000
No! You're being scary!

06:01.600 --> 06:02.830
Hey, Miri!

06:04.030 --> 06:06.690
I don't like you, Papa! I hate you!

06:08.400 --> 06:09.470
<i>I hate you!</i>

06:09.470 --> 06:10.640
<i>I hate you!</i>

06:10.640 --> 06:11.560
<i>I hate you!</i>

06:12.870 --> 06:14.800
Stick to what you know, man.

06:14.800 --> 06:16.570
B-But I have to...

06:16.570 --> 06:18.890
As a father...

06:27.710 --> 06:28.960
There.

06:28.960 --> 06:30.430
You're going all-in, huh?

06:30.430 --> 06:32.420
Today's the big field trip.

06:32.420 --> 06:34.470
I want Miri to show off the coolest lunch

06:34.470 --> 06:38.520
and make it clear to everyone 
whose daughter is the best!

06:38.520 --> 06:40.320
You're trying to get back on her good side.

06:44.750 --> 06:47.460
Yesterday's thing is still 
eating at you, huh?

06:47.820 --> 06:49.620
Morning, Papa Rei!

06:49.620 --> 06:50.540
Morning.

06:50.540 --> 06:52.390
Morning, Miri!

06:53.940 --> 06:55.160
Today's the big field trip!

06:55.160 --> 06:56.360
Can't wait, huh?

06:56.360 --> 06:58.610
Great weather! Great fun!

06:58.610 --> 06:59.850
I don't like you, Papa.

07:02.200 --> 07:03.570
M-Miri...

07:03.570 --> 07:06.050
You want me to join you at the zoo?

07:06.050 --> 07:06.790
No.

07:07.190 --> 07:09.350
You're not allowed anyway.

07:09.350 --> 07:12.140
See? It says "stay home."

07:10.030 --> 07:14.160
<b>And we kindly ask that parents STAY HOME!</b>

07:12.140 --> 07:14.150
Shut up! I know that!

07:14.150 --> 07:18.580
But it'd be way more fun with 
Papa along! Right, Miri?

07:18.580 --> 07:20.790
I'm going to daycare with Papa Rei today.

07:20.790 --> 07:22.790
Uh? Why?

07:26.170 --> 07:27.990
I'm going now!

07:31.440 --> 07:33.040
"I don't like you, Papa."

07:35.560 --> 07:41.020
If this breakdown in our relationship 
puts Miri on the road to delinquency...

07:44.560 --> 07:45.840
I'm so sorry, Miri.

07:45.840 --> 07:48.520
I should've been more understanding.

07:48.520 --> 07:49.410
Shaddap!

07:49.410 --> 07:50.700
Quit actin' like my papa!

07:50.700 --> 07:54.540
You always got on my nerves, you old fart!

07:56.210 --> 07:57.980
I'm not old!

07:59.240 --> 08:00.410
Oh, crud!

08:04.950 --> 08:06.390
Hey, Rei!

08:06.390 --> 08:07.030
What?

08:07.030 --> 08:09.120
Her lunch! I forgot to put it in her bag!

08:09.120 --> 08:10.790
I gotta drop it off at her daycare!

08:10.790 --> 08:12.520
Huh? But you can't.

08:12.850 --> 08:14.330
The bus already left.

08:13.010 --> 08:15.000
Have fun!

08:15.000 --> 08:17.750
Take care!

08:17.750 --> 08:19.400
Damn it!

08:19.400 --> 08:20.550
You okay?

08:21.030 --> 08:22.220
Wait for me, Miri.

08:22.220 --> 08:24.990
Papa's gonna bring you your lunch!

08:24.990 --> 08:27.360
You are? Why?

08:27.360 --> 08:29.110
It's her big field trip!

08:29.110 --> 08:31.330
The poor kid can't go without her lunch!

08:31.330 --> 08:33.720
But they told you to stay home...

08:33.100 --> 08:35.490
I'll make sure Anna-chan doesn't see me!

08:36.010 --> 08:37.220
Let's go, Rei!

08:37.220 --> 08:38.480
What?!

08:38.690 --> 08:40.010
Why me too?!

08:40.010 --> 08:41.590
For Miri. Come along!

08:41.590 --> 08:44.470
No, I think it's for you...

08:46.950 --> 08:50.200
Now, everyone from Aozora Daycare...

08:50.200 --> 08:53.080
Stay close to Teacher, okay?

08:53.080 --> 08:54.470
Okay!

09:23.000 --> 09:26.250
<b>< Monkey Mountain | Petting Zoo ></b>

09:23.300 --> 09:26.250
We'll go over here next!

09:26.250 --> 09:28.280
Okay!

09:33.100 --> 09:34.650
Monkeys!

09:34.650 --> 09:37.270
Look! A baby monkey!

09:37.270 --> 09:38.930
So cute!

09:38.930 --> 09:40.510
Look at me!

09:44.090 --> 09:46.490
Aw, they left...

09:46.490 --> 09:48.300
Don't do that, Taiga-kun!

09:48.300 --> 09:50.820
You made too much noise and scared it!

09:50.820 --> 09:52.710
It's okay, Miri-chan.

09:52.710 --> 09:55.530
Taiga-kun's just mean. Let's go over there.

10:00.240 --> 10:02.070
Wow, looka that!

10:02.070 --> 10:04.340
It says there's lions over there!

10:04.340 --> 10:06.150
I'm gonna see 'em!

10:06.790 --> 10:08.880
It's not safe to go on your own!

10:08.880 --> 10:10.050
I'll be fine!

10:10.260 --> 10:12.850
Hey! You're gonna get lost!

10:13.200 --> 10:14.180
Miri-chan?

10:14.180 --> 10:15.560
Where are you going?

10:17.800 --> 10:23.060
<b>Pop</b>

10:17.810 --> 10:21.260
I told you, no throwing snacks in!

10:21.260 --> 10:23.050
Sorry.

10:25.790 --> 10:27.540
This place is huge.

10:27.540 --> 10:30.950
Don't worry. We'll find her straight 
off and deliver that lunch!

10:31.910 --> 10:34.540
I've never been to a zoo.

10:43.250 --> 10:46.010
Hey! Where's the lions?

10:46.010 --> 10:47.920
C'mon, let's get back.

10:47.920 --> 10:49.400
Hey, Miri-chan.

10:49.400 --> 10:51.400
I don't see Teacher and the others.

10:52.270 --> 10:53.680
What do we do?

10:53.680 --> 10:55.650
We're all lost.

10:56.290 --> 10:57.540
That's okay!

10:57.540 --> 11:01.340
I got lost before and it ended okay!

11:01.340 --> 11:02.430
You just stick with me!

11:04.350 --> 11:06.950
You come too, Taiga-kun!

11:06.950 --> 11:08.660
Wh-What the...

11:08.660 --> 11:10.600
Wait for us!

11:12.750 --> 11:15.900
Where are you, Miri?!

11:18.220 --> 11:19.480
This feels overboard.

11:19.720 --> 11:21.430
We're professionals.

11:21.430 --> 11:24.310
We do whatever it takes to 
see our mission through!

11:24.790 --> 11:26.140
Target sighted!

11:29.130 --> 11:30.260
<i>What is it?</i>

11:30.260 --> 11:32.950
M-Miri... You...

11:35.790 --> 11:38.250
Oh, him? He's my BF.

11:38.250 --> 11:41.660
We're, like, head-over-heels an' shit.

11:41.660 --> 11:42.500
Love!

11:43.650 --> 11:44.770
Murder!

11:44.770 --> 11:46.260
What?

11:46.260 --> 11:48.370
Illicit fraternization with the opposite sex!

11:48.370 --> 11:50.710
And blatantly flaunting it, at that!

11:50.710 --> 11:51.440
Calm down.

11:51.440 --> 11:55.600
You're gonna regret making 
a move on my little girl!

11:56.760 --> 11:58.600
Th-That brat!

11:58.910 --> 12:00.890
He's got more than one girl?!

12:00.890 --> 12:04.090
Miri's not your plaything!

12:03.210 --> 12:05.150
You're being kind of loud.

12:04.090 --> 12:06.190
Don't think you'll get away with it!

12:06.190 --> 12:09.180
Papa's not gonna let this one slide!

12:06.810 --> 12:08.910
Mama, what's that?

12:08.910 --> 12:10.760
Keep walking. Don't look.

12:09.180 --> 12:12.910
Wake up, Miri!

12:12.510 --> 12:14.970
You think we should call someone?

12:12.910 --> 12:15.390
I'll admit it's all my fault!

12:15.390 --> 12:19.200
Please don't get caught up 
in some hooligan's clutches!

12:22.950 --> 12:24.660
I'm hungry.

12:25.300 --> 12:27.100
Anna-chan!

12:27.100 --> 12:28.720
Miss Anna!

12:28.720 --> 12:30.230
Where is everyone?

12:30.230 --> 12:33.220
Anna-chan! Can you hear me?

12:33.220 --> 12:34.290
Where are you?

12:33.220 --> 12:35.830
Wait, are they lost?

12:34.290 --> 12:35.950
Anna-chan!

12:35.830 --> 12:37.780
Hand over the lunch and let's beat it.

12:35.950 --> 12:38.310
Miss Anna!

12:37.780 --> 12:42.490
No, I need to watch to make 
sure they get back safe.

12:43.680 --> 12:45.730
You're way more conspicuous like that.

12:46.080 --> 12:49.520
Anna-chan'd be super mad if she saw us!

12:49.520 --> 12:51.870
They said absolutely no pare—

12:54.000 --> 12:55.460
What is it?

12:55.460 --> 12:58.450
Um... nothing!

12:58.720 --> 13:00.880
Which way now, Miri-chan?

13:00.210 --> 13:01.670
Close call.

13:00.880 --> 13:02.260
This way!

13:01.670 --> 13:03.420
She sensed our unseen presence.

13:03.420 --> 13:05.120
Great instincts, my girl!

13:05.120 --> 13:07.080
Those are our genes at work.

13:07.080 --> 13:08.230
Our <i>what</i>?

13:13.300 --> 13:14.970
M-Miri-chan?

13:14.970 --> 13:18.360
Sorry, I thought I saw Anna-chan.

13:18.700 --> 13:19.510
Let's go!

13:19.510 --> 13:20.780
O-Okay...

13:20.780 --> 13:22.330
Close one.

13:22.330 --> 13:24.280
She does seem to have a knack for this.

13:35.860 --> 13:37.960
Jeez, I'm too tired.

13:37.960 --> 13:39.420
Don't talk like that, Taiga-kun!

13:39.420 --> 13:41.720
We need to get back to Anna-chan!

13:40.580 --> 13:41.720
Taiga?

13:41.720 --> 13:43.770
Wait, isn't Taiga...

13:44.120 --> 13:46.510
Taiga-kun was being bad.

13:46.510 --> 13:49.960
The one Miri supposedly hit?

13:49.960 --> 13:51.420
I hope things are okay.

13:51.420 --> 13:53.580
You think they'll get in a fight again?

13:53.580 --> 13:55.730
I need a break!

13:56.320 --> 13:58.330
He's always so selfish.

13:58.330 --> 14:00.510
Let's take a break, then.

14:01.050 --> 14:03.110
I'm thirsty!

14:07.150 --> 14:08.510
I'll wipe it.

14:08.510 --> 14:09.780
Leave him alone.

14:11.280 --> 14:13.840
Hey! I'm fine! Cut it out!

14:13.840 --> 14:16.030
No. Just hold still.

14:16.370 --> 14:20.370
She's looking after the kid she fought with?

14:20.370 --> 14:21.300
Admirable.

14:25.120 --> 14:27.370
I feel lots better after water!

14:27.370 --> 14:28.860
Yeah, me too!

14:34.940 --> 14:37.300
You didn't beep it!

14:38.270 --> 14:41.230
Stuff at the store. 
You're supposed to beep it.

14:41.230 --> 14:42.940
At the supermarket, too.

14:42.940 --> 14:45.070
It's gotta go beep before you can take it.

14:48.490 --> 14:49.830
You gotta beep it!

14:49.830 --> 14:52.330
Shut up, you little brat!

14:54.890 --> 14:56.080
I'm sorry.

14:56.380 --> 14:58.500
I left the store unattended.

14:58.500 --> 14:59.950
Are you trying to buy those?

15:00.620 --> 15:02.880
Nah. I don't want 'em anymore.

15:04.290 --> 15:05.870
I'll get you for this.

15:06.590 --> 15:09.080
Miri-chan, who was that?

15:09.080 --> 15:10.790
Miri-chan, you okay?

15:10.790 --> 15:15.010
Yeah. I was just telling 
him he's gotta beep it!

15:15.010 --> 15:17.000
Who was that guy?

15:17.000 --> 15:19.140
Lots of shifty types around here.

15:21.650 --> 15:23.540
Anna-chan!

15:23.540 --> 15:25.330
Where could she be?

15:29.520 --> 15:31.380
It's <i>Morio Kart</i>!

15:31.380 --> 15:32.440
Yeah!

15:32.440 --> 15:34.300
I love <i>Morio Kart</i>!

15:34.300 --> 15:35.990
You know about it?

15:35.990 --> 15:37.730
My papa's so good about it!

15:37.730 --> 15:39.950
He gets first place on all the races!

15:39.950 --> 15:40.910
For real?!

15:40.910 --> 15:42.050
That's super cool!

15:42.320 --> 15:43.850
Wait, you know the one thing?

15:43.850 --> 15:46.260
The platinum parts you get 
if you beat all the races?!

15:46.260 --> 15:48.060
Papa's got them all!

15:48.060 --> 15:49.050
Wow!

15:49.240 --> 15:52.600
Then what about the super 
booster perfect yellow?!

15:49.390 --> 15:51.730
Taiga-kun's having fun.

15:51.730 --> 15:53.430
It's like they're friends now.

15:52.600 --> 15:53.430
He's got it!

15:53.430 --> 15:56.570
Wow! Your papa's so awesome!

15:56.570 --> 15:59.380
Yeah! I love Papa Rei!

15:59.380 --> 16:01.540
Miri!

16:03.180 --> 16:06.520
Why are you always the one getting 
credit at times like this?!

16:06.520 --> 16:09.080
Come visit and Papa will teach you!

16:09.080 --> 16:09.860
Okay!

16:22.130 --> 16:24.050
Hey, Miri-chan.

16:24.050 --> 16:25.420
I'm hungry.

16:25.700 --> 16:27.960
Let's eat our lunches.

16:28.770 --> 16:29.960
Lunches?!

16:29.880 --> 16:31.060
I wanna eat too!

16:29.960 --> 16:30.620
Uh-oh.

16:33.550 --> 16:37.070
Then let's eat and 
go back to searching!

16:37.070 --> 16:38.060
Okay!

16:39.720 --> 16:42.050
Thank you for the food!

16:43.330 --> 16:44.740
Ta-da!

16:44.740 --> 16:46.340
So cute!

16:47.550 --> 16:48.620
Huh?

16:48.620 --> 16:49.800
What the...

16:49.800 --> 16:51.870
My lunch!

16:51.870 --> 16:53.850
You forgot to bring it?

16:54.190 --> 16:56.110
Huh?

16:56.110 --> 16:57.620
I gotta take it to her!

16:57.620 --> 16:59.330
You can't let them see you!

16:59.330 --> 17:01.250
But the poor kid!

17:03.320 --> 17:04.500
What's that?

17:04.500 --> 17:05.350
Take it.

17:08.040 --> 17:09.360
You sure?

17:10.000 --> 17:12.050
We're both Morio Kart racers, right?

17:12.970 --> 17:14.490
Yeah!

17:14.490 --> 17:16.750
Thanks, Taiga-kun!

17:17.430 --> 17:19.270
Let's all eat together!

17:19.270 --> 17:21.170
But...

17:21.170 --> 17:25.580
Taiga-kun's gonna steal our fried 
chicken and be mean again.

17:25.580 --> 17:27.110
You won't do that, right?

17:31.200 --> 17:33.540
I won't do it again. Sorry.

17:36.150 --> 17:37.520
Okay, then!

17:37.520 --> 17:38.800
Cool!

17:38.800 --> 17:41.280
Let's all eat together!

17:44.110 --> 17:46.050
These rice balls are so tasty!

17:47.180 --> 17:50.380
My mom makes the best rice balls ever!

17:50.380 --> 17:52.830
Guess I'll take this home.

17:53.290 --> 17:55.950
That Taiga kid's pretty cool.

17:55.950 --> 17:57.260
Yeah.

17:57.260 --> 17:58.040
But...

17:58.040 --> 18:01.100
I'll never accept him as Miri's BF!

18:02.310 --> 18:03.670
Hand it over!

18:03.670 --> 18:06.400
I'm so hungry I can't think, dammit!

18:05.310 --> 18:06.400
Miri-chan!

18:06.710 --> 18:07.770
No!

18:08.760 --> 18:10.520
Knock it off, kid!

18:10.520 --> 18:11.450
Cut it out!

18:13.780 --> 18:16.240
Stay outta my way, brat!

18:14.520 --> 18:16.240
Let go!

18:16.610 --> 18:18.040
It's bad to be mean!

18:18.260 --> 18:19.430
You...

18:19.430 --> 18:21.070
You're that kid from before!

18:21.070 --> 18:22.820
You let Taiga-kun go!

18:26.450 --> 18:28.830
Shut up and hand over the food,

18:28.830 --> 18:31.220
or else I'll...

18:39.260 --> 18:40.850
Wh-Wh-Who the hell are you guys?!

18:40.850 --> 18:43.980
A rabbit and alpaca who just 
happened to be passing by, pyon.

18:43.980 --> 18:46.100
Unhand the kid, paca.

18:46.930 --> 18:48.690
I don't gotta take this crap...

18:49.350 --> 18:50.230
Pyon...

18:50.650 --> 18:52.030
Pyon!

18:52.730 --> 18:53.390
Pyon!

19:00.140 --> 19:02.620
Y-Y-You son of a...

19:05.660 --> 19:06.730
Paca!

19:09.180 --> 19:11.380
Your punishment, paca.

19:12.700 --> 19:13.570
Pyon!

19:14.510 --> 19:16.340
It's just a toy, pyon.

19:16.340 --> 19:17.950
Yeah!

19:17.950 --> 19:19.580
Alpacas are so strong!

19:20.110 --> 19:22.350
Are you unharmed, children?

19:22.640 --> 19:24.600
Thank you, Mr. Rabbit!

19:24.850 --> 19:27.430
You saved all my friends!

19:28.950 --> 19:30.170
Awesome!

19:30.170 --> 19:31.480
Thanks so much!

19:31.480 --> 19:33.330
As long as you're safe, pyon.

19:33.690 --> 19:35.240
So long, paca.

19:35.240 --> 19:36.980
Take care, pyon.

19:36.980 --> 19:38.600
Bye-bye!

19:37.820 --> 19:39.600
See you later!

19:40.200 --> 19:41.450
Goodbye!

19:40.800 --> 19:42.260
Thanks!

19:41.420 --> 19:42.690
See you!

19:42.690 --> 19:43.370
Huh?!

19:43.370 --> 19:44.760
Where's my costume?

19:44.760 --> 19:45.780
Where'd they go?

19:48.750 --> 19:50.860
I don't think they recognized us.

19:50.860 --> 19:52.380
Fortuitous, paca.

19:53.970 --> 19:56.250
Miri-chan! Kids!

19:56.780 --> 19:58.100
Anna-chan!

19:57.110 --> 19:58.620
Miss Anna!

19:58.960 --> 20:00.260
I'm so glad!

20:00.510 --> 20:02.830
I was so worried about you!

20:02.830 --> 20:06.030
I'm sorry it took me so long to find you.

20:06.030 --> 20:07.430
We're sorry!

20:07.430 --> 20:08.860
I woulda been fine!

20:08.860 --> 20:10.500
Don't say that, Taiga-kun!

20:10.500 --> 20:13.270
You gotta say you're sorry to Anna-chan!

20:14.100 --> 20:15.890
Anna-chan. Sorry!

20:16.150 --> 20:18.690
What? Miri-chan, Taiga-kun...

20:18.690 --> 20:19.770
Did you two make up?

20:20.790 --> 20:22.580
We've always been friends.

20:22.580 --> 20:24.030
We're both racers!

20:24.030 --> 20:24.920
Yeah!

20:25.630 --> 20:26.990
I see.

20:26.990 --> 20:28.520
They caught him, apparently.

20:28.520 --> 20:30.860
The convenience store robber? Here?!

20:30.440 --> 20:34.940
This field trip is very special, 
so don't wander off, all right?

20:30.860 --> 20:31.880
Yes, isn't that frightening?

20:34.940 --> 20:36.300
Okay!

20:39.520 --> 20:43.190
She's way more attentive than I thought.

20:43.190 --> 20:44.080
Who is?

20:44.080 --> 20:45.940
Miri, I mean.

20:45.940 --> 20:46.560
Yeah.

20:47.170 --> 20:50.990
I had myself all worked up 
about being a proper dad...

20:51.390 --> 20:54.940
But maybe I oughta trust my kid more.

20:57.240 --> 20:59.960
Well... just do your best, I guess.

21:03.510 --> 21:04.600
We're back.

21:05.030 --> 21:07.830
Papa Kazuki! I'm back!

21:07.830 --> 21:08.730
Miri!

21:08.730 --> 21:11.450
The trip was so fun!

21:12.150 --> 21:13.940
I'm so glad.

21:13.940 --> 21:15.030
Oh, yeah...

21:15.030 --> 21:17.460
I'm sorry I forgot to put 
your lunch in your bag.

21:17.460 --> 21:18.600
I was okay!

21:18.600 --> 21:21.870
Also... I met a really big rabbit!

21:22.210 --> 21:23.420
Oh?

21:23.420 --> 21:25.480
I got to hug him!

21:25.480 --> 21:26.730
Wasn't there an alpa—

21:26.730 --> 21:28.540
Did you, really?!

21:28.540 --> 21:31.900
Put your things away, 
then wash your hands and gargle!

21:31.900 --> 21:33.220
Okay!

21:34.090 --> 21:34.930
Look.

21:38.040 --> 21:39.430
A note from Anna-chan?

21:39.430 --> 21:42.870
She said yesterday's "fight" was Miri 
trying to stop him from being mean,

21:42.870 --> 21:44.890
and her hand just accidentally hit him.

21:44.890 --> 21:49.620
So Miri didn't hit him, 
and they weren't fighting?

21:49.910 --> 21:50.970
Looks like.

21:52.370 --> 21:54.490
Papa Kazuki!

21:54.770 --> 21:57.410
I wanna eat the lunch you made!

22:00.260 --> 22:01.920
Miri!

22:01.920 --> 22:05.250
I'm sorry! It was all my fault!

22:05.250 --> 22:07.500
You didn't do anything wrong!

22:07.500 --> 22:09.180
That's tickly!

22:09.480 --> 22:11.960
I love you, Papa!

22:09.480 --> 22:12.320
You're such a good kid!

22:12.320 --> 22:14.670
There, there, there, there!

22:16.940 --> 22:21.980
<i>The scenery never changes and 
every day is full of surprises</i>

22:21.980 --> 22:26.450
<i>But those are the best parts</i>

22:26.450 --> 22:31.200
<i>Wrapped around your finger 
and going in circles</i>

22:31.450 --> 22:36.080
<i>These days are dizzying yet endearing</i>

22:36.290 --> 22:40.630
<i>On your restless nights, 
I softly whisper a lullaby</i>

22:40.630 --> 22:45.380
<i>And stroke your hair to the 
rhythm of your breathing</i>

22:45.840 --> 22:49.970
<i>I just want these days to 
continue as long as possible</i>

22:49.970 --> 22:54.970
<i>Even if it's just a day</i>

22:55.770 --> 23:00.690
<i>I chased after you as you ran barefoot</i>

23:00.690 --> 23:04.900
<i>Maybe one day, you'll surpass me, ah</i>

23:04.900 --> 23:09.570
<i>I wonder what tomorrow's going to be like</i>

23:09.570 --> 23:14.490
<i>Why don't we walk together?</i>

23:14.490 --> 23:19.250
<i>This will always be our place to come home to</i>

23:19.750 --> 23:24.040
<i>And it'll shine down on our sadness</i>

23:24.040 --> 23:28.720
<i>That's all right, yeah, that's okay</i>

23:28.720 --> 23:33.640
<i>Let's try to share our love together</i>

23:33.640 --> 23:38.520
<i>Let the light always shine upon hope</i>

23:38.980 --> 23:43.560
<i>When the future is unpredictable</i>

23:46.900 --> 23:49.650
<b>Yadorigi
Coffee • Light Meals</b>

23:52.410 --> 23:53.600
Welco—

23:56.380 --> 23:57.600
Karin-chan?
